sections.text:
*Special Missions, when locked, shows whatseems to be Nemesis Prime. This was the closest instance of Optimus Prime's evil clone appearing in the game.

{{Special Missions}}
Category:Missions

{{Dia|red|Marissa Faireborn|Commander? Good, it's just you and your squad. I have a covert mission.}}
{{DiaC|red|Scorponok and Waspinator have been gathering scrap and assembling something.}}
{{DiaC|red|Follow them and report back. They may be hard to find--}}
{{DiaRT|grey|Waspinator|OVER HERE! WAZZZPINATOR IZZZ YELLING! COME HERE SNAPPY-CLAWZZZ!}}
{{Dia|red|Marissa|I am both impressed AND disappointed. Keep driving them forward, I'll have someone meet you up ahead.}}

{{DiaRT|grey|Scorponok|WHICH WAY DID YOU GO!}}
{{DiaRT|grey|Waspinator|OVER HERE! WAZZZPINATOR FOUND MORE MATERIALZZZ!}}
{{dia|purple|Kickback|Keep it down-down! I am trying to stalk the Maximal cat-cat!}}
{{dia|grey|Scorponok|CHEETOR? I'm on board, where do we find him?}}
{{DiaRT|grey|Waspinator|DO NOT GET DIZZZTRACTED!}}
{{DiaRT|grey|Scorponok|I'M NOT DISTRACTED! I'M JUST DOING SOMETHING ELSE FOR A BIT!}}
{{dia|purple|Kickback|Enough-enough! I will make you quiet myself-myself!}}

Part 3
* Cheetor: That saved me a bit of trouble, thanks you two...now scram!
* Scorponok: When did you get here?
* Cheetor: Been tracking you for a while. Figured your noise would good cover, and it was!
* Waspinator: Kitty-bot izzz lazy, not driven like mighty Predaconzzz!
* Cheetor: This has been fun but I can't get off track. Commander, Primal sent me to--
* Scorponok: Ah hah! A distraction! Just like we thought. Time to declaw this cat...
* WITH MY CLAWS.
* Waspinator: WORD PLAY! CLEVER!

